        "id": "2124877757817704933",
        "text": "Jensen Huang says he loves working with Elon Musk\n\nAnd he explains why.\n\nMusk uses Nvidia's technology three ways at once.\n\nTraining his own AI models.\n\nDeploying them, like Grok, where demand is skyrocketing.\n\nAnd renting it out.\n\nVery few companies do all three.\n\nMusk also loves the place where computing meets the physical build-out.\n\nJensen: \"Nobody knows more about energy than he does.\"\n\nSo they went after a new market together.\n\nData centers in space.\n\nTheir two engineering teams were working super closely to create a new type of server.\n\nA new architecture that might work great in space, and on Earth.\n https://t.co/QRnADSt7kN",
